---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-10 mb-10">
      <div
        class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-96 rounded-2xl border border-white/25 overflow-hidden"
      >
        <img
          src="/images/gen1.jpeg"
          alt="Leah smiling in her kitchen"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>

      <div
        class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-96 rounded-2xl border border-white/25 overflow-hidden"
      >
        <img
          src="/images/yoga17.jpeg"
          alt="Leah practicing yoga"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/40 p-8 md:p-14 text-center md:text-left">
      <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sm text-white/60 mb-4">
        About Me
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-4xl mb-6">Hi, I'm Leah</h1>

      <div class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed space-y-4 md:columns-2 md:gap-10">
        <p>
          a Registered Associate Nutritionist and RYT-500 Yoga Instructor, passionate about helping people build healthier, more sustainable habits around food, movement and everyday wellbeing.
        </p>

        <p>
          My approach is person-centred, evidence-based and grounded in behaviour change. I use motivational interviewing and coaching techniques to help you explore your own goals, build confidence and make realistic changes that fit into your life, step by step in a safe and supportive environment.
        </p>

        <p>
          Alongside personalised nutrition support, I incorporate yoga and mindful movement to help you develop a more connected and sustainable approach to your health.
        </p>

        <p>
          My passion for health and wellbeing has been shaped by my experiences of living across different cultures. These experiences taught me that the way we eat, move and feel is influenced by so much more than individual choices from our mindset and beliefs to our environment and sense of community.
        </p>

        <p>
          My own experiences and challenges also led me to discover the powerful role that nutrition, movement and mindfulness can play in how we feel, ultimately shaping the direction of my career.
        </p>

        <p>
          Today, I bring these areas together to create a supportive, non-judgemental space where you can feel empowered to make positive changes at your own pace in a way that works for you and your life.
        </p>

        <p>
          Nutrition • Yoga • Behaviour Change • Motivational Interviewing • Mindful Movement
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white text-terra-500">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-center">
      <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sm text-terra-500/70 mb-4">
        Credentials
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-8">
        Registrations &amp; Qualifications
      </h2>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8 mb-8">
        <img
          src="/images/anutr.png"
          alt="AfN ANutr Registered Associate Nutritionist"
          class="h-24 w-auto bg-white border border-terra-500/25 rounded-lg p-3"
        />

        <img
          src="/images/ryt-500.jpeg"
          alt="Registered Yoga Teacher RYT 500, Yoga Alliance"
          class="h-24 w-auto bg-white border border-terra-500/25 rounded-lg p-3"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-left max-w-xl mx-auto">
        <div class="border border-terra-500/25 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-terra-500/85">
            Registered Associate Nutritionist (ANutr), Association for
            Nutrition
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-terra-500/25 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-terra-500/85">
            Registered Yoga Teacher (RYT 500), Yoga Alliance
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
